steps.body:
Maya, one more thought on your note. Seven of your partners came from people you had worked with: that is a story about how you sell, and the checklist has a section on telling it.

Should I send it?

{{sender_first_name}}

Maya, here is how a year with swanbase works. We work with founders all year, from the first pitch to the months after the round.

If Tidewell needs that kind of support before and after the pre-seed, a 20-minute call is enough to see whether it fits.

{{sender_first_name}}
